    "name": "Acrylic knife",
    "description": "<p>This acrylic knife is manufactured using <strong>3-axis CNC machining</strong> . Milling is performed on both the <strong>front and back surfaces</strong> , as well as the central blade <strong>slot</strong> . After machining, the parts are fastened with four <strong>M2</strong> screws to complete the assembly. The product is made of <strong>acrylic</strong> , and the final surface finish can be achieved through <strong>flame</strong> <strong>polishing or UV texture printing.</strong></p>",
