    "post_processing": "<img src=\"https://cdn.makerables.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto/m/upload-desc/images/15-mvbudkcc.png?f=auto\" alt=\"15\" title=\"15\"><p><strong>Surface finishing note:</strong> The finished part is recommended to be immersed in acrylic polishing liquid for about 3 seconds for surface treatment. Avoid touching the part directly with your hands during and after the process. Alternatively, flame polishing can be used.</p>",
